      "statement": "rtl3's own sources are not vendored into the axiom repo; every Makefile/SConscript in examples/flexnngine2_rtl3_accel pulls them from a sibling gem5_cva6 checkout via a GEM5_CVA6 variable defaulting to /home/julian/gem5_cva6.",
