      "statement": "flexnngine2_rtl3_accel's config reuses gem5_cva6's own precompiled test ELF unmodified and runs it under a full-system bare-metal RiscvTimingSimpleCPU rather than SE mode, because the ELF signals completion via a tohost write rather than an OS syscall.",
