    {
      "id": "claim_7ef215ff28e448d8983d044305b75bf6",
      "statement": "Flexnngine2Rtl3Accel::isIdle() overrides RTLDmaDevice's idle-gating hook by reading the DUT's own dma_busy_o pin rather than inferring idleness from AXI activity, because dma_busy_o stays high through the compute phase where neither AXI port has traffic in flight.",
